{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43144","headline":"谢人惠琴材 · 谢邈","name":"谢人惠琴材","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风撼桐丝带月明，羽人乘醉截秋声。\n七弦妙制饶仙品，三尺良材称道情。\n池小未开春浪泛，岳低犹欠暮云生。\n何因乞与元中术，临化无妨膝上横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢邈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}